<title>USA: P-Com gets $3.5 mln in orders.</title>
<headline>P-Com gets $3.5 mln in orders.</headline>
<dateline>CAMPBELL, Calif. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>P-Com Inc said it received purchase orders for digital millimeter wave radio systems and associated services from Orange Personal Communications Services Ltd in the U.K.</p>
<p>It said the orders are valued in excess of $3.5 million.</p>
</text>
